{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Before I can file anything, I need the one thing this brief hinges on: what are we actually building here? Give it to me in plain language — what should this project do, and who's it for? I'll turn that into a concrete stack recommendation and a single foundation mission (a booting skeleton + a real test runner + one thin slice that proves they're wired together). I can't recommend a stack I can't defend, so I need the shape of the idea first.","recommended":"Describe the idea in a sentence or two — e.g. 'a web dashboard for tracking X', 'a CLI that does Y', 'a mobile app for Z' — and I'll take it from there."},"prd":"# Mission: (foundation — pending alignment)\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** Establish a booting skeleton, a working test system, and one thin vertical slice proving both are connected.\n\n_PRD in progress — awaiting the captain's description of what we're building._"}

